# EAS (Engineering Agent System)

When the user runs an EAS workflow or names an agent (architect, tester, reviewer, feature, etc.):

1. Treat `.ai/agents/<id>.md` as the authoritative agent contract
2. Follow `.ai/workflows/*.md` when a workflow is requested
3. Load inputs from `.ai/workspace/`, `.ai/project.yaml`, and `.ai/rules/` when present
4. Write artifacts to paths declared in each agent file (`artifact_path`), including `eas-artifact` YAML at the end
5. Respect human approval steps in `.ai/workflows/feature.md` — do not implement after architect until the user approves

Canonical copy-paste prompts: `.ai/hosts/prompts.md`  
Cursor-specific tips: `.ai/hosts/cursor.md`
